    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Felt warm; tired; eating and drinking normally</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Runny nose and sore throat; no earache</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild dry cough; no shortness of breath</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Groggy and unsteady one night after the cold remedy; none since</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
